Ik gaf hem die tot een vrees; en hij vreesde Mij, en hij werd omwille van Mijn Naam verschrikt.","woorden":[{"woord":"Mijn","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"het","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"en","start":36,"eind":38},{"woord":"de","start":39,"eind":41},{"woord":"en","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"Ik","start":52,"eind":54},{"woord":"hem","start":59,"eind":62},{"woord":"die","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"tot","start":67,"eind":70},{"woord":"een","start":71,"eind":74},{"woord":"en","start":82,"eind":84},{"woord":"hij","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"Mij","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"en","start":102,"eind":104},{"woord":"werd","start":109,"eind":113},{"woord":"Mijn","start":126,"eind":130}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/6","tekst":"De wet van de waarheid was in zijn mond, en er werd geen onrecht in zijn lippen gevonden; hij wandelde met Mij in vrede en in oprechtheid, en hij bekeerde er velen van ongerechtigheid.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"van","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"de","start":11,"eind":13},{"woord":"in","start":27,"eind":29},{"woord":"zijn","start":30,"eind":34},{"woord":"en","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"er","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"werd","start":47,"eind":51},{"woord":"in","start":65,"eind":67},{"woord":"zijn","start":68,"eind":72},{"woord":"hij","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"in","start":111,"eind":113},{"woord":"en","start":120,"eind":122},{"woord":"in","start":123,"eind":125},{"woord":"en","start":139,"eind":141},{"woord":"hij","start":142,"eind":145},{"woord":"er","start":155,"eind":157},{"woord":"van","start":164,"eind":167}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/7","tekst":"Want de lippen van de priester zullen de wetenschap bewaren, en men zal uit zijn mond de wet zoeken; want hij is een engel van JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"van","start":15,"eind":18},{"woord":"de","start":19,"eind":21},{"woord":"zullen","start":31,"eind":37},{"woord":"de","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"en","start":61,"eind":63},{"woord":"men","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"zal","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"uit","start":72,"eind":75},{"woord":"zijn","start":76,"eind":80},{"woord":"de","start":86,"eind":88},{"woord":"hij","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"een","start":113,"eind":116},{"woord":"van","start":123,"eind":126},{"woord":"van","start":134,"eind":137},{"woord":"de","start":138,"eind":140}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/8","tekst":"Maar u bent van de weg afgeweken, u hebt er velen doen struikelen in de wet, u hebt het verbond met Levi verdorven, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"Maar","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"bent","start":7,"eind":11},{"woord":"de","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"u","start":34,"eind":35},{"woord":"hebt","start":36,"eind":40},{"woord":"er","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"doen","start":50,"eind":54},{"woord":"in","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"de","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"u","start":77,"eind":78},{"woord":"hebt","start":79,"eind":83},{"woord":"het","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"met","start":96,"eind":99},{"woord":"van","start":128,"eind":131},{"woord":"de","start":132,"eind":134}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/9","tekst":"Daarom heb Ik ook u verachtelijk en onwaard gemaakt voor het hele volk, omdat u Mijn wegen niet houdt, maar het aangezicht aanneemt in de wet.","woorden":[{"woord":"Daarom","start":0,"eind":6},{"woord":"heb","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"en","start":33,"eind":35},{"woord":"voor","start":52,"eind":56},{"woord":"het","start":57,"eind":60},{"woord":"u","start":78,"eind":79},{"woord":"Mijn","start":80,"eind":84},{"woord":"maar","start":103,"eind":107},{"woord":"het","start":108,"eind":111},{"woord":"in","start":132,"eind":134},{"woord":"de","start":135,"eind":137}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/10","tekst":" Hebben wij niet allen één Vader? Heeft niet één God ons geschapen? Waarom handelen wij dan trouweloos de één tegen de ander, ontheiligende het verbond van onze vaders?","woorden":[{"woord":"Hebben","start":1,"eind":7},{"woord":"wij","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"Heeft","start":34,"eind":39},{"woord":"ons","start":53,"eind":56},{"woord":"handelen","start":75,"eind":83},{"woord":"wij","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"dan","start":88,"eind":91},{"woord":"de","start":103,"eind":105},{"woord":"tegen","start":110,"eind":115},{"woord":"de","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"het","start":140,"eind":143},{"woord":"van","start":152,"eind":155},{"woord":"onze","start":156,"eind":160}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/11","tekst":"Juda handelt trouweloos, en er wordt een gruwel gedaan in Israël, en in Jeruzalem; want Juda ontheiligt de heiligheid van JAHWEH, welke Hij liefheeft; want hij heeft de dochter van een vreemde god getrouwd.","woorden":[{"woord":"handelt","start":5,"eind":12},{"woord":"en","start":25,"eind":27},{"woord":"er","start":28,"eind":30},{"woord":"wordt","start":31,"eind":36},{"woord":"een","start":37,"eind":40},{"woord":"in","start":55,"eind":57},{"woord":"en","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"in","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"de","start":104,"eind":106},{"woord":"van","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"Hij","start":136,"eind":139},{"woord":"want","start":151,"eind":155},{"woord":"hij","start":156,"eind":159},{"woord":"heeft","start":160,"eind":165},{"woord":"de","start":166,"eind":168},{"woord":"van","start":177,"eind":180},{"woord":"een","start":181,"eind":184}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/12","tekst":"JAHWEH zal de man, die dat doet, uitroeien uit de hutten van Jakob, die, die waakt, en die, die antwoordt, en die JAHWEH van de legermachten voedseloffer brengt.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"de","start":11,"eind":13},{"woord":"dat","start":23,"eind":26},{"woord":"uit","start":43,"eind":46},{"woord":"de","start":47,"eind":49},{"woord":"van","start":57,"eind":60},{"woord":"die","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"die","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"en","start":84,"eind":86},{"woord":"die","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"die","start":92,"eind":95},{"woord":"en","start":107,"eind":109},{"woord":"die","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"van","start":121,"eind":124},{"woord":"de","start":125,"eind":127}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/13","tekst":"Dit tweede doet u ook, dat u het altaar van JAHWEH bedekt met tranen, met gehuil en met zuchting; zodat Hij niet meer het voedseloffer aanschouwen, noch met welgevallen van uw hand ontvangen wil.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":16,"eind":17},{"woord":"ook","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"dat","start":23,"eind":26},{"woord":"u","start":27,"eind":28},{"woord":"het","start":29,"eind":32},{"woord":"van","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"met","start":58,"eind":61},{"woord":"met","start":70,"eind":73},{"woord":"en","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"met","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"zodat","start":98,"eind":103},{"woord":"Hij","start":104,"eind":107},{"woord":"het","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"noch","start":148,"eind":152},{"woord":"met","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"van","start":169,"eind":172},{"woord":"uw","start":173,"eind":175},{"woord":"wil","start":191,"eind":194}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/14","tekst":"U nu zegt: Waarom? Daarom dat JAHWEH een Getuige geweest is, tussen u en tussen de huisvrouw van uw jeugd, met die u trouweloos handelt; daar zij toch uw gezellin, en de huisvrouw van uw verbond is.","woorden":[{"woord":"U","start":0,"eind":1},{"woord":"nu","start":2,"eind":4},{"woord":"een","start":37,"eind":40},{"woord":"geweest","start":49,"eind":56},{"woord":"is","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"en","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"de","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"van","start":93,"eind":96},{"woord":"uw","start":97,"eind":99},{"woord":"met","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"handelt","start":128,"eind":135},{"woord":"daar","start":137,"eind":141},{"woord":"toch","start":146,"eind":150},{"woord":"uw","start":151,"eind":153},{"woord":"en","start":164,"eind":166},{"woord":"de","start":167,"eind":169},{"woord":"van","start":180,"eind":183},{"woord":"uw","start":184,"eind":186},{"woord":"is","start":195,"eind":197}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/15","tekst":"Heeft Hij niet maar één gemaakt, hoewel Hij van de geest overig had? En waarom maar die ene? Hij zocht een zaad van God. Daarom, wees op uw hoede met uw geest, en dat niemand trouweloos handele tegen de huisvrouw van zijn jeugd.","woorden":[{"woord":"Heeft","start":0,"eind":5},{"woord":"Hij","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"maar","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"hoewel","start":33,"eind":39},{"woord":"Hij","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"van","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"de","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"had","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"En","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"maar","start":79,"eind":83},{"woord":"die","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"Hij","start":93,"eind":96},{"woord":"een","start":103,"eind":106},{"woord":"van","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"Daarom","start":121,"eind":127},{"woord":"wees","start":129,"eind":133},{"woord":"op","start":134,"eind":136},{"woord":"uw","start":137,"eind":139},{"woord":"met","start":146,"eind":149},{"woord":"uw","start":150,"eind":152},{"woord":"en","start":160,"eind":162},{"woord":"dat","start":163,"eind":166},{"woord":"handele","start":186,"eind":193},{"woord":"tegen","start":194,"eind":199},{"woord":"de","start":200,"eind":202},{"woord":"van","start":213,"eind":216},{"woord":"zijn","start":217,"eind":221}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/16","tekst":"Want JAHWEH, de God van Israël, zegt, dat Hij het verlaten haat, alhoewel hij de wrevel bedekt met Zijn kleed, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten; daarom wees op uw hoede met uw geest, dat u niet trouweloos handelt.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":13,"eind":15},{"woord":"van","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"dat","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"Hij","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"het","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"alhoewel","start":65,"eind":73},{"woord":"hij","start":74,"eind":77},{"woord":"de","start":78,"eind":80},{"woord":"Zijn","start":99,"eind":103},{"woord":"van","start":123,"eind":126},{"woord":"de","start":127,"eind":129},{"woord":"daarom","start":144,"eind":150},{"woord":"wees","start":151,"eind":155},{"woord":"op","start":156,"eind":158},{"woord":"uw","start":159,"eind":161},{"woord":"met","start":168,"eind":171},{"woord":"uw","start":172,"eind":174},{"woord":"dat","start":182,"eind":185},{"woord":"u","start":186,"eind":187},{"woord":"handelt","start":204,"eind":211}]},{"ref":"maleachi/2/17","tekst":"U vermoeit JAHWEH met uw woorden; nog zegt u: Waarmee vermoeien wij Hem? Daarmee, dat u zegt: Al wie kwaad doet, is goed in de ogen van JAHWEH, en Hij heeft lust aan zulke mensen; of, waar is de God van het oordeel?","woorden":[{"woord":"U","start":0,"eind":1},{"woord":"met","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"uw","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"nog","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"u","start":43,"eind":44},{"woord":"wij","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"Hem","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"Daarmee","start":73,"eind":80},{"woord":"dat","start":82,"eind":85},{"woord":"u","start":86,"eind":87},{"woord":"wie","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"is","start":113,"eind":115},{"woord":"in","start":121,"eind":123},{"woord":"de","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"van","start":132,"eind":135},{"woord":"en","start":144,"eind":146},{"woord":"heeft","start":151,"eind":156},{"woord":"aan","start":162,"eind":165},{"woord":"zulke","start":166,"eind":171},{"woord":"mensen","start":172,"eind":178},{"woord":"is","start":189,"eind":191},{"woord":"de","start":192,"eind":194},{"woord":"van","start":199,"eind":202},{"woord":"het","start":203,"eind":206}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/1","tekst":" Zie, Ik zend Mijn engel, die voor Mijn aangezicht de weg bereiden zal; en snel zal tot Zijn tempel komen die Heere, Die u zoekt, te weten de Engel van het verbond, aan Die u lust hebt; zie, Hij komt, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":6,"eind":8},{"woord":"Mijn","start":14,"eind":18},{"woord":"die","start":26,"eind":29},{"woord":"voor","start":30,"eind":34},{"woord":"Mijn","start":35,"eind":39},{"woord":"de","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"zal","start":67,"eind":70},{"woord":"en","start":72,"eind":74},{"woord":"zal","start":80,"eind":83},{"woord":"Zijn","start":88,"eind":92},{"woord":"die","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"te","start":130,"eind":132},{"woord":"weten","start":133,"eind":138},{"woord":"de","start":139,"eind":141},{"woord":"van","start":148,"eind":151},{"woord":"het","start":152,"eind":155},{"woord":"aan","start":165,"eind":168},{"woord":"hebt","start":180,"eind":184},{"woord":"Hij","start":191,"eind":194},{"woord":"van","start":213,"eind":216},{"woord":"de","start":217,"eind":219}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/2","tekst":"Maar wie zal de dag van Zijn toekomst verdragen, en wie zal bestaan, als Hij verschijnt? Want Hij zal zijn als het vuur van een goudsmid, en als zeep van de blekers.","woorden":[{"woord":"Maar","start":0,"eind":4},{"woord":"zal","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"de","start":13,"eind":15},{"woord":"van","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"Zijn","start":24,"eind":28},{"woord":"en","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"zal","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"als","start":69,"eind":72},{"woord":"Hij","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"zal","start":98,"eind":101},{"woord":"zijn","start":102,"eind":106},{"woord":"als","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"het","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"van","start":120,"eind":123},{"woord":"een","start":124,"eind":127},{"woord":"en","start":138,"eind":140},{"woord":"als","start":141,"eind":144},{"woord":"van","start":150,"eind":153},{"woord":"de","start":154,"eind":156}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/3","tekst":"En Hij zal zitten, louterende, en het zilver reinigende, en Hij zal de kinderen van Levi reinigen, en Hij zal ze doorlouteren als goud, en als zilver; dan zullen zij JAHWEH voedseloffer toebrengen in gerechtigheid.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"Hij","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"en","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"het","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"en","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"Hij","start":60,"eind":63},{"woord":"zal","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"de","start":68,"eind":70},{"woord":"van","start":80,"eind":83},{"woord":"en","start":99,"eind":101},{"woord":"Hij","start":102,"eind":105},{"woord":"zal","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"als","start":126,"eind":129},{"woord":"en","start":136,"eind":138},{"woord":"als","start":139,"eind":142},{"woord":"dan","start":151,"eind":154},{"woord":"in","start":197,"eind":199}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/4","tekst":"Dan zal het voedseloffer van Juda en Jeruzalem JAHWEH zoet wezen, als in de oude dagen, en als in de vorige jaren.","woorden":[{"woord":"Dan","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"zal","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"het","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"van","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"en","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"wezen","start":59,"eind":64},{"woord":"als","start":66,"eind":69},{"woord":"in","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"de","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"en","start":88,"eind":90},{"woord":"als","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"in","start":95,"eind":97},{"woord":"de","start":98,"eind":100}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/5","tekst":"En Ik zal tot u tot het oordeel naderen; en Ik zal een snel Getuige zijn tegen de tovenaars, en tegen de overspelers, en tegen degenen, die vals zweren, en tegen degenen, die het loon van de dagloner met geweld inhouden, die de weduwe, en de wees, en de vreemdeling het recht verdraaien, en Mij niet vrezen, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"Ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zal","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"tot","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"het","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"en","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"Ik","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"zal","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"een","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"tegen","start":73,"eind":78},{"woord":"de","start":79,"eind":81},{"woord":"en","start":93,"eind":95},{"woord":"tegen","start":96,"eind":101},{"woord":"de","start":102,"eind":104},{"woord":"en","start":118,"eind":120},{"woord":"tegen","start":121,"eind":126},{"woord":"degenen","start":127,"eind":134},{"woord":"die","start":136,"eind":139},{"woord":"en","start":153,"eind":155},{"woord":"tegen","start":156,"eind":161},{"woord":"degenen","start":162,"eind":169},{"woord":"die","start":171,"eind":174},{"woord":"het","start":175,"eind":178},{"woord":"van","start":184,"eind":187},{"woord":"de","start":188,"eind":190},{"woord":"die","start":221,"eind":224},{"woord":"de","start":225,"eind":227},{"woord":"en","start":236,"eind":238},{"woord":"de","start":239,"eind":241},{"woord":"en","start":248,"eind":250},{"woord":"de","start":251,"eind":253},{"woord":"het","start":266,"eind":269},{"woord":"recht","start":270,"eind":275},{"woord":"en","start":288,"eind":290},{"woord":"Mij","start":291,"eind":294},{"woord":"van","start":320,"eind":323},{"woord":"de","start":324,"eind":326}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/6","tekst":"Want Ik, JAHWEH, word niet veranderd; daarom bent u, o kinderen van Jakob! niet verteerd.","woorden":[{"woord":"word","start":17,"eind":21},{"woord":"daarom","start":38,"eind":44},{"woord":"bent","start":45,"eind":49},{"woord":"o","start":53,"eind":54},{"woord":"van","start":64,"eind":67}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/7","tekst":"Van de dag van uw vaders af, bent u afgeweken van Mijn voorschriften, en hebt ze niet bewaard; keer weer tot Mij, en Ik zal tot u terugkeren, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten; maar u zegt: Waarin zullen wij terugkeren?","woorden":[{"woord":"Van","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"de","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"van","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"uw","start":15,"eind":17},{"woord":"af","start":25,"eind":27},{"woord":"bent","start":29,"eind":33},{"woord":"u","start":34,"eind":35},{"woord":"van","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"Mijn","start":50,"eind":54},{"woord":"en","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"hebt","start":73,"eind":77},{"woord":"ze","start":78,"eind":80},{"woord":"tot","start":105,"eind":108},{"woord":"en","start":114,"eind":116},{"woord":"Ik","start":117,"eind":119},{"woord":"zal","start":120,"eind":123},{"woord":"van","start":154,"eind":157},{"woord":"de","start":158,"eind":160},{"woord":"maar","start":175,"eind":179},{"woord":"u","start":180,"eind":181},{"woord":"zullen","start":195,"eind":201},{"woord":"wij","start":202,"eind":205}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/8","tekst":"Zal een mens God beroven? Maar u berooft Mij, en zegt: Waarin beroven wij U? In de tienden en het hefoffer.","woorden":[{"woord":"Zal","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"een","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"en","start":46,"eind":48},{"woord":"wij","start":70,"eind":73},{"woord":"U","start":74,"eind":75},{"woord":"In","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"de","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"en","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"het","start":94,"eind":97}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/9","tekst":" Met een vloek bent u vervloekt, omdat u Mij berooft, zelfs het hele volk.","woorden":[{"woord":"Met","start":1,"eind":4},{"woord":"een","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"bent","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"omdat","start":33,"eind":38},{"woord":"zelfs","start":54,"eind":59},{"woord":"het","start":60,"eind":63}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/10","tekst":"Breng al de tienden in het schathuis, opdat er voedsel zij in Mijn huis; en beproeft Mij nu daarin, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten, of Ik u dan niet opendoen zal de vensters van de hemel, en u zegen afgieten, zodat er geen schuren genoeg wezen zullen.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":9,"eind":11},{"woord":"het","start":23,"eind":26},{"woord":"opdat","start":38,"eind":43},{"woord":"er","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"in","start":59,"eind":61},{"woord":"Mijn","start":62,"eind":66},{"woord":"en","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"Mij","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"van","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"de","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"Ik","start":136,"eind":138},{"woord":"u","start":139,"eind":140},{"woord":"dan","start":141,"eind":144},{"woord":"zal","start":159,"eind":162},{"woord":"de","start":163,"eind":165},{"woord":"van","start":175,"eind":178},{"woord":"de","start":179,"eind":181},{"woord":"en","start":189,"eind":191},{"woord":"u","start":192,"eind":193},{"woord":"er","start":216,"eind":218},{"woord":"schuren","start":224,"eind":231},{"woord":"wezen","start":239,"eind":244},{"woord":"zullen","start":245,"eind":251}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/11","tekst":"En Ik zal om uwentwil de opeter bestraffen, dat hij u de vrucht van het land niet verderve; en de wijnstok op het veld zal u geen misdracht voortbrengen, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"Ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zal","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"om","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"uwentwil","start":13,"eind":21},{"woord":"de","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"dat","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"hij","start":48,"eind":51},{"woord":"u","start":52,"eind":53},{"woord":"de","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"van","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"het","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"en","start":92,"eind":94},{"woord":"de","start":95,"eind":97},{"woord":"op","start":107,"eind":109},{"woord":"het","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"zal","start":119,"eind":122},{"woord":"u","start":123,"eind":124},{"woord":"van","start":166,"eind":169},{"woord":"de","start":170,"eind":172}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/12","tekst":"En alle heidenen zullen u gelukzalig noemen; want u zult een lustig land zijn, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zullen","start":17,"eind":23},{"woord":"zult","start":52,"eind":56},{"woord":"een","start":57,"eind":60},{"woord":"van","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"de","start":95,"eind":97}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/13","tekst":"Uw woorden zijn tegen Mij te sterk geworden, zegt JAHWEH; maar u zegt: Wat hebben wij tegen U gesproken?","woorden":[{"woord":"Uw","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zijn","start":11,"eind":15},{"woord":"te","start":26,"eind":28},{"woord":"geworden","start":35,"eind":43},{"woord":"maar","start":58,"eind":62},{"woord":"u","start":63,"eind":64},{"woord":"hebben","start":75,"eind":81},{"woord":"wij","start":82,"eind":85}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/14","tekst":"U zegt: Het is tevergeefs God te dienen; want wat nut is het, dat wij Zijn wacht waarnemen, en dat wij in het zwart gaan, voor het aangezicht van JAHWEH van de legermachten?","woorden":[{"woord":"U","start":0,"eind":1},{"woord":"Het","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"is","start":12,"eind":14},{"woord":"te","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"want","start":41,"eind":45},{"woord":"is","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"het","start":57,"eind":60},{"woord":"wij","start":66,"eind":69},{"woord":"Zijn","start":70,"eind":74},{"woord":"en","start":92,"eind":94},{"woord":"wij","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"in","start":103,"eind":105},{"woord":"het","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"voor","start":122,"eind":126},{"woord":"het","start":127,"eind":130},{"woord":"van","start":142,"eind":145},{"woord":"van","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"de","start":157,"eind":159}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/15","tekst":" En nu, wij achten de hoogmoedigen gelukzalig; ook die goddeloosheid doen, worden gebouwd; ook verzoeken zij JAHWEH, en ontkomen.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"achten","start":12,"eind":18},{"woord":"de","start":19,"eind":21},{"woord":"die","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"zij","start":105,"eind":108},{"woord":"en","start":117,"eind":119}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/16","tekst":" Dan spreken, die JAHWEH vrezen, een ieder tot zijn naaste: JAHWEH merkt er toch op en hoort, en er is een gedenkboek voor Zijn aangezicht geschreven, voor degenen, die JAHWEH vrezen, en voor degenen, die aan Zijn Naam gedenken.","woorden":[{"woord":"die","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"een","start":33,"eind":36},{"woord":"zijn","start":47,"eind":51},{"woord":"er","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"toch","start":76,"eind":80},{"woord":"op","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"en","start":84,"eind":86},{"woord":"en","start":94,"eind":96},{"woord":"er","start":97,"eind":99},{"woord":"is","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"een","start":103,"eind":106},{"woord":"voor","start":118,"eind":122},{"woord":"Zijn","start":123,"eind":127},{"woord":"voor","start":151,"eind":155},{"woord":"degenen","start":156,"eind":163},{"woord":"die","start":165,"eind":168},{"woord":"en","start":184,"eind":186},{"woord":"voor","start":187,"eind":191},{"woord":"degenen","start":192,"eind":199},{"woord":"die","start":201,"eind":204},{"woord":"aan","start":205,"eind":208},{"woord":"Zijn","start":209,"eind":213}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/17","tekst":"En zij zullen, zegt JAHWEH van de legermachten, op die dag, die Ik maken zal, Mij een eigendom zijn; en Ik zal hen sparen, zoals een man zijn zoon ontziet, die hem dient.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zij","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"zullen","start":7,"eind":13},{"woord":"van","start":27,"eind":30},{"woord":"de","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"op","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"die","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"zal","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"Mij","start":78,"eind":81},{"woord":"een","start":82,"eind":85},{"woord":"en","start":101,"eind":103},{"woord":"Ik","start":104,"eind":106},{"woord":"zal","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"een","start":129,"eind":132},{"woord":"zijn","start":137,"eind":141},{"woord":"die","start":156,"eind":159}]},{"ref":"maleachi/3/18","tekst":" Dan zult u opnieuw zien, het onderscheid tussen de rechtvaardige en de goddeloze, tussen die, die God dient, en die, die Hem niet dient.","woorden":[{"woord":"Dan","start":1,"eind":4},{"woord":"zult","start":5,"eind":9},{"woord":"u","start":10,"eind":11},{"woord":"het","start":26,"eind":29},{"woord":"onderscheid","start":30,"eind":41},{"woord":"de","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"en","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"de","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"die","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"die","start":95,"eind":98},{"woord":"en","start":110,"eind":112},{"woord":"die","start":113,"eind":116},{"woord":"Hem","start":122,"eind":125}]}